<%- include('../partials/head', {title}) %><body class="auth-body"><main class="auth-layout"><section class="auth-brand-panel"><a class="brand brand-light" href="/"><span class="brand-mark"><i class="bi bi-layers-half"></i></span><span>teamforge<span class="brand-dot">.</span></span></a><div class="auth-pitch"><div class="eyebrow"><span class="pulse-dot"></span>A BETTER WAY TO BUILD</div><h1>One workspace.<br>More room to <em>build.</em></h1><p>Bring your projects, technical knowledge, and team activity into one thoughtful workspace.</p><div class="auth-pitch-foot"><span><i class="bi bi-shield-check"></i> Private by default · Built for engineering teams</span></div></div><div class="auth-grid-decoration"></div></section><section class="auth-form-panel"><div class="auth-form-wrap"><div class="mobile-brand"><span class="brand-mark"><i class="bi bi-layers-half"></i></span>teamforge<span class="brand-dot">.</span></div><div class="auth-heading"><div class="eyebrow">GET STARTED</div><h2>Create your account</h2><p>Join your team on TeamForge.</p></div><div class="form-alert" id="form-error" role="alert"></div><form id="register-form"><label>Full name<input name="name" placeholder="Alex Kim" autocomplete="name" required minlength="2"></label><label>Work email<input name="email" type="email" placeholder="you@company.com" autocomplete="email" required></label><label>Password<input name="password" type="password" placeholder="At least 10 characters" autocomplete="new-password" minlength="10" required></label><button class="button button-primary button-full" type="submit">Create account <i class="bi bi-arrow-right"></i></button></form><p class="auth-switch">Already have an account? <a href="/login">Sign in</a></p><p class="auth-legal">New accounts start with developer access. An administrator can change roles.</p></div></section></main><script src="/js/auth.js" defer></script></body></html>
